                                                "sense_id": "0cd61f5b-0f7e-336f-9ccf-540791ea11e2",
                                                "text": "Liara: We have to hurry. The whole place is caving in!\nShepard: Joker! Get the Normandy airbone and lock in on my signal. On the double, mister!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
